HB0308 Cryptographic Frontiers Act.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Singh, Filer, Wasserburger and Yin
AN ACT relating to trade and commerce; requiring the attorney general to
investigate specified federal overreach involving blockchain or cryptocurrency
related actions reported by Wyoming residents; authorizing the attorney general
to file or intervene in lawsuits as specified; providing definitions; and
providing for an effective date.
1/28/2025 Bill Number Assigned
